{"unit_id":"Shad0wwa1ker__dsh-per-request-cost#card-zh","repo":"Shad0wwa1ker/dsh-per-request-cost","commit":"dbb9dfa982024124993b61ea040b2115002737e9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-per-request-cost 是 DeepSeek Harness Web 插件，在会话输入框下方显示账户余额、当前峰谷时段和会话费用。它通过 Host 的 sessionCost 投影按每条请求开始时的时段与模型档位累计 token 费用，并统计 DeepSeek Search/Fetch 费用；浏览器组件还展示直接子会话费用、余额拆分和节假日时段。可在插件设置页调整余额刷新频率。适合希望在对话时查看 DeepSeek 账户余额和会话花费的用户；需要已登录的 Harness 账号，不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:392-501","index.js:240-411"]}
{"unit_id":"Shad0wwa1ker__dsh-per-request-cost#card-en","repo":"Shad0wwa1ker/dsh-per-request-cost","commit":"dbb9dfa982024124993b61ea040b2115002737e9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-per-request-cost shows DeepSeek balance, billing phase, and session cost in the Harness composer. It prices requests, tracks Search and Fetch charges, and includes direct child-session costs. Users can change balance refresh timing. Requires a signed-in Harness account.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:392-501","index.js:240-411"]}
